ottom:9pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Purchase Agreement specifies assets and liabilities that are excluded from the Asset Sale and retained by the Company. Retained assets include the Company's net operating loss carryforwards and other tax attributes, insurance policies, assets of certain foreign retained entities, and certain other assets detailed in the Purchase Agreement and disclosure schedules. Retained liabilities include the Company's term loan and related warrant liabilities, accrued payroll and commissions, liabilities of certain foreign retained entities, and certain other liabilities related to the retained assets and other contracts and matters identified in the Purchase Agreement and disclosure schedules.</span></div></ix:continuation><div id="i95120cc047e040a4906c8f221ebbbd1c_43"></div><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:6pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">4. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:CashCashEquivalentsAndShortTermInvestmentsTextBlock" id="f-486" continuedAt="f-486-1" escape="true">Cash and Cash Equivalents</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfCashCashEquivalentsAndShortTermInvestmentsTableTextBlock" id="f-487" continuedAt="f-487-1" escape="true"><ix:continuation id="f-486-1" continuedAt="f-486-2"><div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The amortized cost and estimated fair value of the Company&#8217;s cash and cash equivalents as of&#160;January&#160;31, 2026 and July&#160;31, 2026 were as follows (in thousands):</span></div></ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric><div style="height:54pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;positio